{"base":"69c8717a31f5ff77c9ae1d91994cf4ffcc06959c","description":"Replace raw public key identifiers (NodeId) with decentralized\nidentifiers (DID) from radicle::identity::DID for the release author,\nartifact location keys, and attestation sets. NodeId is retained only\nfor cob::Store trait bounds which require it.\n\nArtifacts are signed by users (or agent identities like CI bots), not\nnodes, and since Radicle is moving toward separating user and node\nconcepts, using DID future-proofs the schema against that divergence.","oid":"a42215c0815345a6225e98eea80c2e0953fb0bc5","type":"revision"}